# FitTrack backend URL.
#
# Leave unset during development: the app automatically targets the machine
# running `expo start` on port 6001 (works for emulators and LAN devices).
#
# REQUIRED for production/EAS builds — point it at your deployed backend:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-fittrack-backend.vercel.app
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
